{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google安全研究員詹姆斯福肖日前在社交媒體上吐槽微軟的安全漏洞，福肖稱自己發現某個蠢得離譜的 UAC 用户賬户控制繞過方式，福肖諷刺遭到利用的組件像是 AI 編碼的產物。不過福肖目前並未公佈具體受影響的組件、漏洞利用方式和具體受影響的版本。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587010.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.085101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:34:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_hash":"577ebd099f3723d9199687b31dbaaaeed7715ab507fbd3a3cc939e103e2f2901","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}